user_templates.add_specific:
Make one minimal edit that makes the sentence more specific by clarifying exactly one existing detail, referent, action, relation, or condition. Preserve every existing substantive detail. Do not add an example, explanation, purpose, background claim, or unsupported fact. If a proper name, number, identifier, version, command, or location is not licensed by the sentence, do not invent it. Return one sentence of at most {add_word_limit} words (original: {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

user_templates.de_specify:
Make one minimal edit that makes the sentence less specific by removing or generalizing exactly one concrete detail or qualifier. Add nothing. Preserve all other wording and factual commitments, including polarity and modality. Return one sentence no longer than {de_word_limit} words (original: {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}

user_templates.irrelevant_rewrite:
Make one minimal wording or syntax paraphrase with approximately the same specificity. Preserve every concrete detail and factual commitment, at least 60 percent of content words verbatim, and every polarity and modal word exactly. Add or remove no detail. Return one sentence between {neutral_word_min} and {neutral_word_max} words (original: {original_word_count}).

Original sentence:
{sentence_original}
